 a38 tui   1 Overview   2 Events   3 Sessions                    ? help  q quit 
 KEYS  (esc back)
  1 2 3, tab   switch the view: overview, events, sessions
  j k, ↓ ↑     move or scroll; pgdown pgup, g G: start and end
  enter        detail of an event, timeline of a session
  esc          back
  /            search text in the events
  f            filter: project= session= ref= type= code=
  c            clear the filter and the search
  t            time range: today, 7 days, 30 days, all
  r            read the audit log again and check the chain
  ?            this help
  q, ctrl+c    quit

 NOTES
  The view only reads the audit log. It never writes and never talks to the
  daemon.
  The filter for project and session also selects the figures. The filter for
  ref, type and code and the search select only the events.
  Session name, agent, task and reason are claims of the agent and not
  verified.
  The how-to "Freigaben auswerten" explains each figure.
